      "trackName": "Candy Rain  Watch Game",
      "description": "Candy Rain Watch Game is a sweet Match-3 puzzle built for quick play on your wrist!\n\nSwap delicious candies, clear board obstacles, and solve fun puzzle levels on the go.\n\nHOW TO PLAY:\n\nMatch 3 Candies: Swap adjacent candies to line up 3 of the same sweet treats to clear them.\nMake Combos: Match 4 or 5 candies to trigger special candy bombs and clearing effects.\nBeat Levels: Clear target candies and obstacles before running out of moves.\nUse Boosters: Use power-ups to blast through tough spots and hard lines.\nFEATURES:\n\nFast and fun Match-3 gameplay built for your wrist.\nVibrant candy graphics and smooth animations.\nHundreds of sweet puzzle stages.\nPerfect for quick casual breaks offline.\nDownload Candy Rain Watch Game today and start matching sweets on your wrist!",
